# Phase 3

The live-exam API stages are complete. Their record is `docs/phases/phase-3/phase-3-status.md`.

**Outdated — do not follow:**

- This phase is `api/` only. Do not add exam screens under `mobile/` or `web/`.
- Do not add a payment gateway.
- Do not add notices.

Public catalog reads, per-exam and full-module purchase, a Master Admin publish step for written results, Google sign-in, website notifications, and the student website are later work. Plan that work from `docs/exam-site/README.md`. The outdated lines in `docs/phases/phase-3/phase-3-scope.md` name the same conflicts.

**Still in force:**

The earlier stages `api-exam-module` through `api-question-bank` are superseded. Do not extend them. Do not treat their exits as proof of the live-exam rules.

Do not open a browser, install an emulator, or run a device check for the mobile app. Automated API checks use real PostgreSQL. Do not use H2. Do not add a mobile or web CI workflow.

Reuse Phase 1 delete and activation conventions. A new `INSTRUCTOR` role uses the System Admin create-and-activate path. Do not redesign passwords. Do not put an exam node on a course content tree. Do not add attendance or batches.

New exam tables start at Flyway `V24`. Do not alter `V14`–`V23` to impersonate this model. Package: `com.coachingcenter.api.exams`.

Before writing exam API code, read `api/.cursor/rules/api-exam-invariants.mdc`. The outdated lines in that file are marked.
